            <td data-label="Your next gate">{item.gate}</td>
            <td data-label="What the first degree adds">{item.edge}</td>
          </tr>
        ))}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <p class="note-line">
    Dates and fees in this guide were checked in October 2026 against secondary reports of official notices. Confirm each one on the official site before you register.
  </p>

  <h2 id="route-map">The route map: ten routes, labelled</h2>

  <p>
    The order is deliberate. Routes where you can set your own price and grow by adding clients, people or packages come first. Routes that run on a fixed ladder or on beating rivals at stage after stage come later, and stay in the list with their risk named.
  </p>

  <div class="legend">
    <span class="tag tag--teal">Scalable</span>
    <span class="tag tag--gold">Scalable with a business layer</span>
