          </tr>
        ))}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <div class="highlight-box highlight-box--teal">
    <p>
      <strong>Why the lead routes lead.</strong> Compliance advisory sells a skill directly, in packages, to many businesses, so you control price and reach. A boutique practice scales through your fees, juniors and repeat clients. A salaried post, however respected, caps at a pay band.
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>Skill portfolio first.</strong> In every row, one core skill (drafting, procedure or a regulation) plus one multiplier (a sector, a second language, basic data or AI use) plus proof another person can check is what separates strong outcomes from the median.
    </p>
  </div>

