  <h2 id="judiciary-change">Judiciary: the rule changed twice in fifteen months</h2>

  <p>
    A lot of advice online still repeats the May 2025 rule as if it is final. It is not.
  </p>

  <div class="protocol-stack">
    {judiciarySteps.map((item) => (
