            <td data-label="One number to watch">{item.number}</td>
          </tr>
        ))}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <p>
    Clear English, written and spoken, moves every row of that table, because clients, judges and employers all judge you first by how plainly you explain. Keep it basic: say who you help and with what, make one clear offer, show proof others can check, follow up, ask for referrals, and have one honest price conversation. None of this promises income. It is the minimum for anyone who wants to earn beyond one employer or one senior.
  </p>

  <h2 id="ai-by-route">What AI changes, route by route</h2>

  <p>
    AI hits the most repeatable work first: bulk document review, standard contract checks and first-draft research. That is why LPO and the early years of a corporate firm are the most exposed. Advocacy, negotiation and the signature a person must own stay human.
  </p>

  <div class="comparison-grid">
